; ORDER-205 — EA_BREAKOUT_XAU clean re-optimize ranges (XAUUSD H1)
; Param names verified against ea_projects/EA_BREAKOUT_XAU/EA_BREAKOUT_XAU.mq5 (14 inputs, _NN_ scheme).
; The 2026-06 funnel's ini files used the PRE-RENAME Inp* names, which no longer exist on this
; .ex5 — unlisted inputs fall back to the per-terminal cache, so those ranges may never have
; applied. That is a second reason this re-optimize exists.
; Frozen on purpose: BuyOnly (incumbent v2 is long-only), ATR block, lot/magic/deviation.
; Swept: BreakoutBars, SlAtrMult, TpAtrMult, EmaPeriod = 8 x 6 x 7 x 5 = 1680 combos
;   -> over the 1,000 ceiling, so coarse runs GENETIC (Criterion 7), fine runs COMPLETE.
_00_OptimizeMode=false||false||0||true||N
_01_BreakoutBars=40||25||5||60||Y
_02_SlAtrMult=1.5||1.0||0.5||3.5||Y
_02_TpAtrMult=5.0||3.0||1.0||9.0||Y
_03_AtrPeriod=14||14||1||14||N
_03_AtrMaPeriod=20||20||1||20||N
_03_AtrExpandRatio=1.0||1.0||0.1||1.0||N
_04_UseDailyEma=true||false||0||true||N
_04_EmaPeriod=200||50||50||250||Y
_05_BuyOnly=true||false||0||true||N
_05_LotSize=0.01||0.01||0.01||0.01||N
_06_Magic=991001||991001||1||991001||N
_06_Deviation=20||20||1||20||N
_06_AllowLive=false||false||0||true||N
